					"usage_notes": "Add +1d per level of Psyker Talent to this line (GCS can't scale it automatically; edit the damage on the sheet). Usable only by a psyker (Psyker Talent 1+), field on. Requires a Perils of the Warp check (see \"Psykers and the Warp\") as it is channelled through the wielder's own gift; the ignores-DR component only applies against daemons, Chaos Spawn, and other Warp-touched creatures, representing a strike at the target's soul rather than its body — an ordinary flak-armoured guardsman still only takes the field-on line's armour divisor (10).\n",
