					"usage_notes": "Every Nemesis weapon is permanently attuned for anti-daemon work; Grey Knights need no Perils of the Warp check to use this line against a Warp-touched target, field on (their Sanctic training and armour wards absorb the backlash), though the GM may still call for one against anything else it is used on.\n",
